            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>The principles of NeoGen nitrogen plasma technology, its mechanism of action and treatment considerations; appropriate indications and patient selection; treatment parameters and differences in recovery profiles; contraindications, safety and risk management; clinical photography, case studies and a portfolio of results; and how high-profile patient treatments are building awareness and patient demand.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_xtJV4E": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Medical-grade skincare before and after NeoGen",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>How ALLSKIN | MED can prepare the skin ahead of treatment, how medical-grade skincare can support recovery and help reduce downtime, the role of SCA® PRO Growth Factor technology, and how ongoing collagen support and homecare can help enhance treatment results.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_MKUqLU": {
